  (text "DAC8: 2x AD5754 in daisy-chain: MOSI -> U1.SDIN, U1.SDO -> U2.SDIN,\nU2.SDO -> MISO (48-bit frames, 1x CS). LDAC = busijn -> beide chips.\nOffset binary (BIN->DVCC); ADR421 2.5V ref; uit = +-10V range.\nKanaal->DAC: CV1=U1.B CV2=U1.A CV3=U1.C CV4=U1.D CV5=U2.A ... CV8=U2.D" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 30 0)
